== Documented Changes ==
=== Balance Changes ===
* Chance to find max level [[Shop]]s in [[Hard mode]] increased to 50%, and back to how they were previously in normal mode.
* Added [[Machines#Restock Machine|Restock Machines]] back to Shops, with a 25% chance to replace the [[Donation Machine]].
** This does not occur in game and is only documented.
* [[Rocks#Tinted Rocks|Tinted rocks]] are now more common in Hard

=== General Fixes ===
* Fixed a crash caused by dying and reviving during the [[Rotgut]] fight
* Fixed a crash caused by {{I|Mucormycosis}} tears
* [[Reap Creep]] can no longer appear on the [[Scat Man]] challenge to reduce the likelihood of unfair softlocks
* Fixed [[Pills#I Found Pills|I Found Pills]] causing {{C|Keeper}}, {{C|Apollyon}}, {{C|???}}, and {{C|The Forgotten}}'s head to disappear
* Fixed [[Chub]] and other bomb eating bosses causing a crash when swallowing [[Rocket in a Jar|rockets]]
* Fixed being able to unlock {{I|Golden Razor}} by saving and resuming a run or by entering a certain area
* Fixed {{I|Doctor's Remote}} getting canceled when taking damage before the rocket hits the ground
* Fixed [[Delirium|Delirium's]] death animation getting stuck in an endless loop when he dies while slowed or sped up
* Added a tentative fix for corrupted graphics caused by burrowing enemies on AMD graphics drivers
* Entering certain floors now attempts to place the player in a safe spot to prevent instant damage from any room hazards
* Fixed pickup animation getting stuck when using certain active items while holding a [[Bombs|red bomb]]
* Fixed [[Bestiary Repentance|Bestiary]] entries for some [[Vis]] enemies that were missing graphics
* Touching certain fires no longer triggers {{I|Shard of Glass}} bleed effect
* Touching certain fires no longer rerolls [[Tainted Eden|Eden]]
* Fixed an unintended interaction with certain fires and {{I|Pyromaniac}}
* Fixed a rare situation involving Eden tokens which could cause the character selection menu to be stuck on the wrong side
* Fixed a crash caused by using {{I|Dark Arts}} while having {{I|Midas' Touch}}
* Fixed {{T|Butter!}} allowing single-use items to be reused endlessly
* Fixed [[Wormwood]] sometimes getting stuck underwater when slowed down
* Lightning flashes in {{s|Downpour}} have had their brightness reduced to accommodate for users with sensitive vision

=== Book of Virtues Fixes ===
* Added {{I|D12}} wisps
* Fixed {{I|Spin to Win}} wisps not dying as expected
* Fixed a crash caused by {{I|Box of Friends}} wisps
* Fixed a possible crash caused by {{I|Diplopia}} wisps
* Fixed a possible crash caused by {{I|Compost}} wisps
* Fixed a possible crash caused by {{I|Stitches}} wisps
* Fixed a possible crash caused by {{I|Ventricle Razor}} wisps
* Fixed interaction between wisps and {{I|BFFS!}}

=== Co-op Fixes ===
* Fixed infinite boss item respawn exploit
* Dead co-op players are now revived only when the end-of-floor boss is defeated
* Fixed challenge runs
* Fixed dead co-op player being able to unlock certain doors
* Fixed not being able to start co-op if Player 1 has one or less red hearts

=== Misc ===
* Added several missing [[Bestiary Repentance|bestiary]] entries
* Updated various room layouts
* Updated sprites for [[Seven Deadly Sins|Sins and Super Sins]]

